# Three Trailblazing Technologies for Schools.

**Authors:** McGinty, Tony

## Abstract
Provides an overview of the capabilities and potential educational applications of CD-ROM (compact disk read-only memory), artificial intelligence, and speech technology. Highlights include reference materials on CD-ROM; current developments in CD-I (compact disk interactive); synthesized and digital speech for microcomputers, including specific products; and artificial intelligence products for educators. (RP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ358365

